   {
    "claim": "With the choke held at 55%, P-3's liquid rate fell from about 1,425 Sm3/d in 2016 to about 295 Sm3/d in 2020, and average flowing BHP fell about 39% from 255 bar to 155 bar.",
    "detail": "Waterflood by_year: liquid_rate 1425 Sm3/d in 2016, 295.44 Sm3/d in 2020, choke_pct 55.0 each year (E4). Yearly BHP: 255.23 bar in 2016, 155.18 bar in 2020 (E7), drop 100.05 bar = 0.392 fraction (E10). No oil or water regime changes except a 14-day field-wide shut-in 2019-06-03 with -5% rate after (E3).",
